  2. Use, keep, publish and redistribute the SBOMs, evidence reports and other
     output that fw2sbom produces from your own firmware images. Output is
     yours; Onecra claims no rights in it.

  3. Read this source code for evaluation, security review and audit. A tool
     that produces supply-chain documents should be open to inspection by the
     people who rely on those documents.


